  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "请客人充当DJ",
   "texts": [
    "/customer-service/product-support/smart-lighting/",
    "NO",
    "ikea://cms/page-compatible-web?url=%2Fcustomer-service%2Fproduct-support%2Fsmart-lighting%2F&key=",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"/customer-service/product-support/smart-lighting/\",\"objectType_var\":\"cms/page-compatible-web\"}",
    "设置一个DJ台，并说明如何连接蓝牙音箱。通过可以变换色彩的照明光源，邀请客人扮演DJ的角色。当你将灯光切换到特定颜色，如紫色，分配紫色的客人就需要在一定时间内负责播放音乐。",
    "请客人充当DJ"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/74b8378efbe7b8af/original/PH168889.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "/customer-service/product-support/smart-lighting/",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/74b8378efbe7b8af/original/PH168889.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "餐边柜上摆放着SYMFONISK 希姆弗斯 WiFi台灯音箱；周围点缀LED蜡烛和小圆烛，上方悬挂SVENSÅS 斯万索斯 钉板。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/74b8378efbe7b8af/original/PH168889.jpg",
     "href": null,
